<title>SWITZERLAND: Nestle may raise coffee prices 10-15 pct.</title>
<headline>Nestle may raise coffee prices 10-15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nestle SA sees a need to raise its coffee prices by 10 to 15 percent to reflect rising market prices, said Robert Raeber, executive vice president in charge of Europe.</p>
<p>&quot;We see a need to increase coffee prices by about 10 to 15 percent depending on markets and the blend,&quot; he told the company's annual news conference, adding Nestle hoped to pass on price rises to consumers.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
